  "description": {
    "text": "Battle Road Summer 2006 held nine tournaments in seven cities from 16 July to 13 August 2006. Everyone in the qualifying round got Masakazu Fukuda's Mew δ, finalists a holo δ Rainbow Energy, and the top three of each division the Victory Orb with Mew, the last Battle Road to give one. Its winners went on to the Champion's League 2006, held that year in Taiwan.",
